WEBVTT

00:51:54.263 --> 00:52:00.149
Like, you don't get to see
why this goes this way.

00:52:00.173 --> 00:52:05.432
It just does. It just does.
It just is. It just did.

00:52:05.456 --> 00:52:08.070
CA: Do you believe in an afterlife?

00:52:08.094 --> 00:52:10.830
Do you believe that this is
just a temporary separation?

00:52:10.854 --> 00:52:13.668
EG: I believe in an always-life.

00:52:13.692 --> 00:52:15.821
I don't know if I can explain that,

00:52:15.845 --> 00:52:19.347
but Rayya is very present within me.

00:52:19.371 --> 00:52:22.654
She is braided into me.

00:52:22.678 --> 00:52:24.778
I'm very comfortable saying,
if nothing else,

00:52:24.802 --> 00:52:27.532
her afterlife is living within me,

00:52:27.556 --> 00:52:28.939
changing me,

00:52:28.963 --> 00:52:31.688
walking through the world with me
and making me different.